              >
                <p
                  className="text-[#374151]"
                  style={{ fontSize: "14px", lineHeight: "22px", margin: 0 }}
                >
                  Wow! Thanks for delivering this ahead of schedule. Really
                  appreciate your speed and quality.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Boldteq reply */}
            <div
              style={{
                display: "flex",
                alignItems: "flex-end",
                justifyContent: "flex-end",
                gap: "8px",
              }}
            >
              <div
                style={{
                  backgroundImage: "linear-gradient(135deg, #082753, #0f3d7a)",
                  borderRadius: "13px",
                  padding: "14px 18px",
                  boxShadow: "0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.06)",
                  maxWidth: "280px",
                }}
              >
                <p
                  className="text-white"
                  style={{ fontSize: "14px", lineHeight: "22px", margin: 0 }}
                >
                  Thank you! Glad we could deliver ahead of time. Let us know
                  if you&apos;d like any changes.
                </p>
              </div>
              <Image
                src="/images/webflow/Group-47034.svg"
                alt="Boldteq icon"
                width={32}
                height={32}
                className="rounded-full flex-shrink-0"
              />
            </div>

            {/* Client message 2 */}
            <div style={{ display: "flex", alignItems: "flex-end", gap: "8px" }}>
              <Image
                src="/images/webflow/f8f0feb98079a1670f1d01ab1aa9fadccc312da5.png"
                alt="Client image"
                width={32}
                height={32}
                className="rounded-full object-cover flex-shrink-0"
              />
              <div
                style={{
                  backgroundColor: "#fff",
                  borderRadius: "13px",
                  padding: "14px 18px",
                  boxShadow: "0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.06)",
                  maxWidth: "280px",
                }}
              >
                <p
                  className="text-[#374151]"
                  style={{ fontSize: "14px", lineHeight: "22px", margin: 0 }}
                >
                  The design looks great! I&apos;m happy with the direction and
                  everything is approved. Please go ahead and move forward
                  with the development phase.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  );
}
